window.products.push({"id":873072,"name":"HOME-X Paper Plate Holder, Plastic Dinnerware, Party, BBQ, and Picnic Accessories","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710qe4RreEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Paper plates have been a staple of family gatherings and parties for nearly a century, from family get-togethers to corporate office luncheons. These plates never change, but the amount of food we layer onto them does. It can be really hard to enjoy a pile of your favorite egg salad and ribs when your paper plate is just seconds away from bending, breaking, or tearing apart. Eventually, all your delicious food will spill through, and not only will you have egg and barbeque sauce all over your face, but you will have them all over your shirt, pants, and shoes. Don’t let the paper plates’ lack of strength ruin your appetite for smoked brisket and mashed potatoes. Instead, use our paper plate holders to support your heaping helpings. You can use our paper plate holders for all kinds of summeractivities, from picnics in the park to birthday bashes in the backyard. Most paper plate brands often absorb the grease and sauces that can come with all kinds of foods, weakening the plate. With their material soggy from food juices, these plates may not be able to handle the extra pressure of a second or third helping. Don’t take the risk of piling food on these flimsy plates when you can use our holders to carry that weight to ensure that your plate won’t crack. This set of paper plate holders comes with 8 holders of varying bright colors that can pair easily with all your other outdoor utensils. Purchase our set of 8 Paper Plate Holders today and experience a no-hassle, spill-free dining experience!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710qe4RreEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07N5LP6WF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-873072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N5LP6WF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N5LP6WF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
