window.products.push({"id":873085,"name":"STONEWOOD Round Placemats Set of 6, 15 inch All-Natural & Heat Resistant Placemats, Water Hyacinth Woven Placemats with 6 pcs Napkin Rings - Eco-Frien","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91X0r2iXMLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROTECT & DECORATE - The wide diameter of the placemats offer a decorative accent that not only protects tables from spills but also adds a pop of color. Tightly woven, thick plant fibers offer durability, heat-resistance, and scratch protection. You can use these placemats under cups, plates, tableware, cooking pots, potted plants or any home decor, adding a non-slip layer of protection to any surface. MATCHING NAPKIN RINGS - Each purchase includes a matching 6 pack of woven rings. Made from the same material, this matching dining accessory will complement the round woven placemats, adding the perfect finishing touch to a modern organic table. GREAT FOR EVERY OCCASION - Perfect for indoor and outdoor dining, providing a natural jute wooden feel for every occasion. This handwoven wicker placemat is lightweight and versatile enough to coordinate with decor from rattan boho chic to rustic farmhouse. Neutral color and burlap basket weave pattern complement each other for a simple yet elegant look. Great for daily meals, parties, and holidays throughout the year. SUSTAINABLE & ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY - Water hyacinth is a plant that is harvested in tropical waterways to control its growth, so it doesn’t clog water flow. By using a renewable material like water hyacinth for this product, we avoid using fossil or finite materials. There are no dyes or chemicals involved in the process. So, you can feel confident that you are purchasing a responsibly made all-natural product. 100% HANDWOVEN WATER HYACINTH - Each place mat is handmade from sustainable water hyacinth seagrass. This durable plant fiber is braided to create a symmetrical spiral pattern with a natural wood color that adds warmth and weight to your table decor. EASY TO CLEAN - Spot clean with a soft, damp cloth. Air dry. Store in a dry area.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91X0r2iXMLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stonewood","source_asin":"B097S2C942","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-873085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097S2C942","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097S2C942","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
