window.products.push({"id":873176,"name":"Tiptiper Tall Storage Cabinet with LED Sensor Light, Linen Bathroom Cabinet with Changhong Glass Doors, 63\" Modern Cupboard Freestanding Tower Cabinet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kBW67v8tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LED human body sensor light strip】-Using PIR technology, infrared human body sensor, the sensing angle is up to 100 degrees, and the sensing distance is 3 meters in front. the sensor light will automatically turn on when you open the cabinet door, and it can be lit under any light conditions. When you close the cabinet door, it will automatically close after 20 seconds, providing you with soft, warm and bright light to ensure that you will not fall in the dark. 【Cabinet with Changhong Glass Door】-The door of this wood nightstand is embedded with a piece of Changhong glass. Changhong glass is a patterned glass with uneven vertical lines, which is more complicated to make, so its strength is several times stronger than ordinary glass, sturdy, durable and safe. In addition, this glass door design can protect the privacy inside your cabinet and add hazy beauty to your room. 【Multi-purpose & Practical】-This cabinet is a stylish storage solution for any room! Besides serving as a bathroom linen cabinet to keep shampoos and towels organized, it also can use as a freestanding tall cabinet in the kitchen dining room to store tableware and glassware, in the living room to store books, wines, and collections, or in the laundry room to store stain cleaners and other daily essentials. 【More Stable】- Built with premium manufactured wood, this bathroom storage cabinet is ready to provide long-lasting durability and an extraordinary experience for you. Meanwhile, 4 base feet and an anti-tip kit add extra stability. 【Easy to Assemble】-This tall cabinet is well packaged in 1 box. Everything that you need to install this comes with the shipping box(all parts, tools, instructions). You can put it together in less than an hour with simple instructions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kBW67v8tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiptiper","source_asin":"B0B7HB11LD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-873176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7HB11LD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7HB11LD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
