window.products.push({"id":873217,"name":"DEMDACO Dogs Rock Bichon Frise Burlap Wall Art, 10-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eKFYO4S5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"It's no secret - we humans love our dogs. That's why Stephen Fowler's playful personification of man's best friend living a busy urban lifestyle - drinking coffee, listening to music, and \"hanging out\" - strikes a cord with everyone. Our latest additions to these graphic tributes of our four-legged companions boast retro-style illustrations featuring bar and jazz icons, plus fabulously fun-loving entertaining pieces from treat plates and brew glasses to tea towels and a cutting board. Stephen Fowler characterizes his work as simple yet eclectic, bold and graphic. Bichon Frise Burlap Wall Art features fun, colorful retro style illustrative artwork on burlap. Materials: wood composite, burlap. Freestanding. Backer: keyhole. Measures: 10\"sq. Fun decor accessory. Makes a great gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eKFYO4S5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEMDACO","source_asin":"B00BDWBFXK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-873217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BDWBFXK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BDWBFXK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
