window.products.push({"id":873298,"name":"HYNAWIN Bamboo Bed Tray with Foldable Legs, Portable Breakfast Tray for Food Serving with Handles, Laptop Tray for Sofa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oQ-c1L7oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Portable Handle Design】Our bed tray designed with handles on two sides for easy moving. Folding legs makes it small for easy storage. 【Made of 100% Bamboo】Our laptop tray is made of 100% bamboo material.The construction is simplistic and the color is natural. Bamboo has its own unique natural lines and clear texture, it gives a simple and elegant fresh feeling. 【Prevent Slipping off】The design of high edge can keep natural texture and high lip edge to prevent items from slipping off. Reasonable size for different use. 【Smooth Surface】This portable breakfast tray table is hand polished and easy to grasp. Compared with wooden furniture, bamboo has stronger physical and mechanical properties. 【Multi-use】Ideal for serving food, snacks, laptop, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oQ-c1L7oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HYNAWIN","source_asin":"B07S61RPMJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-873298","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S61RPMJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S61RPMJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":873299,"name":"EALOMYH Trippy Mushroom Aesthetic Tapestry for Bedroom Wall Hanging Psychedelic Fairy Dope Tapestries Fantasy Ocean Tapestry for Home Decor, dorm and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zxYZcQFWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The room is drab with bare walls and no colors, we need a product that would change the style of the room and make it alive and mysterious. That's why we designed this tapestry, vibrant, gorgeous and eye catching. High Quality Soft, lightweight, silky, durable and no weird smell HD Prints Bright, clear, and no fading, no blurry Easy Care came with non trace nails to hang it. Dry clean or gentle hand wash in cold water. You can also easily iron it at low temperatures. Multi purpose Tablecloth, bedspreads, curtains, backdrop, bed sheet, bedspread, sofa cover, picnic or beach blanket, etc. It can be whatever you want it to be. The trippy tapestry isn’t just a wall hanging for bedroom, but artistic adventures to the unknown mushroom world. So don't hesitate and just buy it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zxYZcQFWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EALOMYH","source_asin":"B096Y92BFP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-873299","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096Y92BFP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096Y92BFP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
