window.products.push({"id":873456,"name":"DIY Wall Clock Modern Design Large 3D Wall Decoration Gift Frameless Used to Decorate The Empty Wall, Like Home, Office, Hotel (Black-2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+zp8HJk8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Feature 1.The 3D numbers are combined by three parts, acrylic mirror surface, EVA and the adhesive, Can Last for About 3-5 Years. 2.Stickers Can be Removable ,With Glue on The Backside, Easy to Paste on The Wall or Any Other Clean and Smooth Surface; Such As Door ,the closet and so on. 3.The mirror with glue, before to paste the sticker on the wall, you need to paste the mirror on the sticker surface first. 4.Please note that a protective film is on the acrylic number surface, please tear the film off after installing the clock. 5. DIY design, clock layout size measured by hands, can be adjust to be smaller or bigger size this is a 3D DIY wall clock,very nice one,high quality one. Sticker Material: EVA Foam (Ethylene vinyl acetate) Clock Material: Metal Hour Hand: 31.3cm or 12.32” Minute Hand: 38.9cm or 15.31” Clock Machine: 12cm or 4.72” Battery:1.5V AA battery 1 piece(without) The round pattern size:60CM（Min）120CM(Max) The clock final decoration size is decided by how you want to decorate you walls. Choose color:Black Silve(Has Mirror Acrylic Pieces) The Modern clock DIY wall clock is ideal to decorate a living room, bedroom, corridor, restaurant, dining room, kitchen, office, hotel, etc. Suitable for most smooth walls. Silence Silent to work The sound is less than 25 decibels You can not hear the sound mostly Accurate Daily error -0.5s ~ +0.5s Long service life Holding every seconds of yourself Tips: If want to remove the numbers just heat the glue up with a heat gun or hair dryer with high heat settings. It shouldn't damage your paint.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+zp8HJk8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DONGGUANBALUN","source_asin":"B08G17JP2D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-873456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G17JP2D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G17JP2D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
