window.products.push({"id":873486,"name":"Donatello Dehumidifiers, Ultra Quiet Small Room Dehumidifiers 300 sq.ft with Defrost & 7 Color Night Light & Auto Off, 39oz Mini Dehumidifier for Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kcEEWcv-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Efficient Dehumidifiers for Home】Still nervous about the humid weather? Just Take it easy! This RV dehumidifiers have low energy consumption (No more than 0.5 kWh per day) with powerful dehumidification. Equipped with a 39oz(1153ml) water tank extracts up to MAX 18oz(532ml) of moisture daily in a humid environment of 86°F and 80% RH, efficiently lower humidity to improve air quality, create a healthy living environment for you. 【Auto Defrost Protection】 The traditional dehumidifier may form frost at a low temperature. This small dehumidifier designed with an automatic defrosting mode, when the temperature is low, the dehumidifiers will automatically turn to the defrosting mode to process defrost automatically, making the unit work continuously and efficiently without periodic stopping during the defrosting process, not only saving the energy but also making the unit last longer. NOTE: Working temp: 46~104℉ (8°C~40°C) 【Ultra-Quiet & Colorful Atmosphere Lights】 The house dehumidifier features Peltier technology and ultra-quiet operation (38dB) creates a comfortable and peaceful environment for your bedroom and office, will not disturb your sleep, work or study. The built-in 7 colors of romantic mood lights and you can set your favorite color. This bedroom dehumidifier creates a sweet and romantic sleeping atmosphere for you. 【Safe Auto Shut Off Protection】 When the water is full, the deshumidificador will automatically shut off and the LED light will turn-on indicating the water tank needs draining. Automatic detection of defrost with an orange light. The portable dehumidifiers is 2.4 lbs, 4.7*4.7*9.8\", You can take it to any small space from 50-300 sq ft such as bathroom, bedroom, basements, Garage, Wardrobe Closet, Kitchen, Office, RV, bookcases, file cabinets, garages, laundry room, cellar, grow tents, etc 【Small Dehumidifiers For RV】This reusable dehumidifiers Including 1* compact dehumidifier, 1*AC adapter, 1*59 inch (150 cm) US plug power cord, 1*user's manual. In addition, we provide 7×24 hours customer service and we will do our best to solve any problems you encounter when using this desktop dehumidifier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kcEEWcv-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Donatello","source_asin":"B0BW76S43W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-873486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW76S43W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW76S43W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
