window.products.push({"id":873489,"name":"MINGPINHUIUS Candle Warmer Lamp with 2 Bulbs, Dimmable Metal Table Candle Lamp with Timer, Electric Melt Wax Crystal Lamp for Scented Jar Candles Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5174OoWbxWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧡【Safety & Environmental】The electric candle warmer lamp works on a 50-watt halogen warming bulb (included) melts the candle form the top down. No open fire, smokeless, no pollution and reduces fire risk. Safer to use, avoid accidental injury to pets or babies. Our candle warmer for jar candles has the three timing adjustment function 2/4/8 hours, you can never worry about warming the candle all the time. 🧡【Eliminate Odor】You can choose your favorite scents to fill your home, it can help you to eliminate the worst smells such as smoke, tobacco, pet urine, garbage, and unpleasant bathroom odor. The candle warmer lantern distributes your favorite candle scent evenly throughout the room for a happiness and soothing at the end of the day. 🧡【Dimmable Light for Setting Brightness】This candle wax melting lamp is easy to install and use. You can freely and simply to use it to heating the wax. You can adjust the brightness of the dimmable bulb according to different needs. The brighter the candle lamp is, the faster the candle melts and the stronger the scent. Bring you the experience of different fragrance concentration. ( Candle not included) 🧡【Candle Lover Perfect Gift】This candle warmer will be the best gift choice to show your love to your families, lover, or friends on Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, New Year, Housewarming or other festivals. ​Warm and melt your favorite candle and enjoy the fragrance of your scented candles. 🧡【Suitable for Home Decoration】An elegant and minimalist candle warmer lamp is definitely a decorative items to match your house. Not only placing the lamp in the bedroom, study room, and living room, but also in the office or coffee shop. Tips: It is recommended to use it continuously for no more than 3-4 hours. Leaving it on for a long time will shorten the life of the lamp or burn it out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5174OoWbxWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MINGPINHUIUS","source_asin":"B0BYDDK6GK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-873489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYDDK6GK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYDDK6GK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
