window.products.push({"id":873573,"name":"ISTRIPMF 24 inch Round Led Mirror with Lights Color Changing Circle Mirror,Dimmable, Anti-Fog, Front and RGB Backlit Lighted Round Mirror","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R8mQ+OThL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Front Lighted and 8 Model Backlit】LED bathroom mirror is designed with front lighted and backlit. There are 8 light modes for backlight (cold light, white light, warm light,colorful, pink, red, green, blue) and 3 light modes for front light (cold light, white light, warm light).Both back light and front light could be dimmable.The backlight can also be adjusted to the same color temperature as the front light. 【Stepless Dimming Mirror】The led round mirror has two built-in LED strips. You can switch colors freely by touching the mirror button. The headlight and backlight of the led mirror can be adjusted separately by two buttons. Long press the button to adjust the brightness from 10% to 100%. The color temperature is between 3000-6000K. Contains memory function. When turned on again, the light will remain in the state it was in when it was last turned off. 【Shatterproof/Corrosion Proof】Our LED mirror is made from stronger glass, that is armored glass. It will not get broken easily. Even it is broken, it will not shatter to piece, no harm, safer to use. With epoxy coating, it will not corrode after 30 days of pickling test. Tempered led bathroom mirror is safer and stronger than glass mirrors on the market. 【Anti-Fog/Waterproof Design】Istripmf round mirror with lights has anti-fog function, you just need to press the button and wait for a few minutes to get a clear reflection image. Say goodbye to haze with a simple touch-sensitive button. The anti-fog mirror is very suitable for bathroom use. 【Standard Plug/Hardwired】Lighted bathroom mirror with a standard plug. Besides, you can cut the plug to connect to the wire, and then you can control it with a switch. It can be installed according to your needs. It is better done by a professional electrician if you want to hardwire it. 【Lifetime Warranty】We will provide lifetime warranty for ISTRIPMF LED lighted bathroom mirror, If you have any problems, please contact us anytime, We will give you satisfactory service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R8mQ+OThL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ISTRIPMF","source_asin":"B0B4NPMS6F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-873573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4NPMS6F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4NPMS6F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
