window.products.push({"id":873581,"name":"RESTURA 1000 Thread Count 2 PC Pillowcases Set 100% Egyptian Cotton, Sateen Finish, Solid Pattern, Elephant Grey - 2 PC Standard Pillowcases","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91o+zwf14bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGHEST QUALITY EGYPTIAN COTTON SHEETS: New Better & Improved 2022 Version - If you love the luxury and durability & look of crisp pillowcases, youÕll adore our Luxurious Sheets, 1000-thread-count. We use yarns made with 100% long staple cotton fibre and a gorgeous sateen weave. Our eco-friendly Pillowcases retain softness for a lifetime and resist fading. Indulge in soft bed sheets with detailed hem styling, also available in your choice of colors and sizes. MAXIMUM COMFORT: 100% Egyptian Cotton Standard Size Pillowcases Only._ 2 Standard Size Pillowcases (20\" x 30\"). LUXURY & COMFORT:- Experience The 5 Star Royalty When You Sleep In These Super Soft 100% Egyptian Cotton Pillow Cover king Size with ultimate sateen feel. This Exquisite thick Sheet Set Has Been Painstakingly Crafted From The Finest Cotton Yarns Keeping Your Comfort In Mind. Some days we do not get enough sleep because of the bed and sheets we sleep on. It may be too hot, too uncomfortable, itchy or rough to your skin causing restless nights. These 100% Egyptian Cotton sumptuous bed sheets are a perfect solution for your home. CARE INSTRUCTIONS:- Machine wash in Cold Water, Do Not Bleach, Tumble Dry Low If Needed, Wash Dark Colors separately. GUARANTEED SATISFACTION: We are committed to quality and customer satisfaction. In case you face any problem, you can write to us directly and get your grievances addressed immediately. Use contact seller option to raise complaints. Our Twin bed sheets are great gift ideas for Christmas, MotherÕs Day, FatherÕs Day, ValentineÕs Day and New YearÕs gifts. Order our King Pillow cases for the most comfortable experience. Leave a feedback after your purchase. Happy sleeping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91o+zwf14bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RESTURA","source_asin":"B0B4JYFSP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-873581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4JYFSP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4JYFSP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
