window.products.push({"id":873851,"name":"Professional Bakers 35x26'' Dough Couche Proofing Cloth, Baking Couche Linen Cloth 100% Pure Cotton Pastry Baguettes Bread Towel for Proofing with a W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WtoMOzI1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Nice combination set: come with a baking proofing cloth and a practical 13\" dough whisk, Our stainless steel Danish dough whisk has a non stick 304 stainless steel head and a long wooden handle, the dough whisk is solid and durable, will not bend, and the dough will not stick on the stainless steel wire head Perfect Size:the large couche is designed with perfect size of 35''×26'', provide you plenty of surface to work multiple loaves.From baguettes to breads of all sizes, they are easy to shape, easy to store, and neatly folded like a kitchen towel Premium materials: the couche fabric is made of classic, 100% cotton linen, which is untreated and unbleached. The linen is ideal as it absorbs excess moisture while minimizing stickiness, and create a crisp crunch associated with French bread.Heavy weight, professional grade fiber suitable for both household and commercial use.Better than cheaper fabrics, they are thick enough and stiff enough to shape the bread Thick and stiff: enough to shape your baguettes ,french bread, loaf. the thick fabric material couche give them support during the last rise. Coarse, dense baguette proofing cloth weave keeps the rising bread from expanding in length, forcing a vertical rise,so they can attain their final shape with much better height, and helps dry the outside Easy to clean: after using, first brush flour off the couche, but if dough sticks to cloth, just wait to dry then scrape off.Do not wash your couche. A real couche should never be washed. Hang and air dry after use, then roll and store it for future use. Because our couche is made of natural and untreated flax linen fabric, the odor you may experience is completely natural. It will not affect the aroma of your bread and it will dissipate in time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WtoMOzI1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LLCHB","source_asin":"B095CR59VT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-873851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095CR59VT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095CR59VT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
