window.products.push({"id":873976,"name":"POZIEA Dish Drying Rack, Compact Dish Rack with Drainboard for Kitchen Counter, Durable 304 Stainless Steel Dish Drainer with Adjustable Drainage and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nKvS7dnTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPACE SAVING DISH RACK:This dish drying rack comes with extra attachements such as cutlery box, wine glass and cup rack to hold more kitchenware. It enables you to store more dishes saving your kitchen countertop from messed up and providing you a comfortable cooking environment with everything organized. ADJUSTABLE WATER DRAINAGE: The dish drying rack with drainboard is designed with a swivel spout which can be elongated and rotated by 180° according to your needs. The cutlery box has a water outlet that could directly lead water to the drip tray. The drip tray could collect the dripping water and draining water directly into the sink. Special design keeps your kitchen clean and dry. RUSTPROOF STAINLESS STEEL: Our dish drying rack is made of excellent 304 stainless steel which could protect the dish rack from rusting and corrosion. Four rubber anti-slip foot at the bottom is designed for stable anod protecting you sink and counter-top from scratching. ANTI-SCRATCH ATTACHMENTS : This dish drying rack comes with 4 rubber anti-slip foot at the bottom of drainboard and 6 cup rack caps whcih are designed for stable anod protecting you counter and cups from scratching. EASY TO ASSEMBLY AND CLEAN: The dish drying rack is detachable, you can easily assemble the simple structure dish rack in 1 minutes. All parts can be removed for easy cleaning. This POZIEA dish drying rack and drainboard set is perfect for every family. Let you have a tidy kitchen! Satisfaction Guaranteed: Our service concept concentrates on CUSTOMER FIRST. If for any reason you have any questions about your purchase or our service, please feel free to reach out to our customer care. We will provide our best service and make things right!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nKvS7dnTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POZIEA","source_asin":"B09BNF8377","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-873976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BNF8377","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BNF8377","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
